            "block_content": "We start by analyzing the error from weight-only quantization. Consider a group/block of weight w; the linear operation can be written as  $ y = \\mathbf{w}x $, and the quantized counterpart is  $ y = Q(\\mathbf{w})x $. Specifically, the quantization",
